WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.960
Well, the administration filed an appeal this morning with the Ninth Circuit.

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:10.320
I would note the administration won an identical case in the Ninth Circuit just a few months

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:14.040
ago with respect to the federalizing of the California National Guard.

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:18.480
Under Title X of the U.S. Code, the president has plenary authority.

